{"id":"mudhead","name":{"en":"Mudhead","ja":"土かぶり"},"desc":{"en":"A mushroom covered in fresh mud. It sometimes pops out of the dirt, tripping anyone passing by. As for its taste, it's quite good.","ja":"地中で成長するために土をかぶっている茸。 人や動物が近づくと、突然ぼこっと地面から 出て来て驚かすという性質を持つ。味の方は 歯ごたえがシャキシャキしてて中々美味しい。"},"level":2,"locations":[{"id":"alanya-west-ruins","name":{"en":"Alanya West Ruins","ja":"アランヤ西部遺跡地帯"}},{"id":"arland-area","name":{"en":"Arland Area","ja":"アーランド周辺地域"}},{"id":"arland-wastelands","name":{"en":"Arland Wastelands","ja":"アーランド東の荒野"}}],"categories":[{"id":"plant","name":{"en":"(Plant)","ja":"（植物類）"},"icon":"totori-category-plant"},{"id":"supplement","name":{"en":"(Supplement)","ja":"（中和剤）"},"icon":"totori-category-supplement"},{"id":"vegetable","name":{"en":"(Vegetable)","ja":"（食材・野菜）"},"icon":"totori-category-vegetable"}],"item_type":"Ingredient","index":2}